ges:"Prices haven’t changed yet",expensesSub:"By periods and categories",services:"Services",servicesSub:"Price list",stats:"Statistics",statsSub:"Income and expenses by month",settings:"Settings",settingsSub:"Connection, computer, appearance",findService:"Find a service",noSuchService:"No such service",emptyPrice:"The price list is empty",activeServices:"Active",noArchived:"The archive is empty",addService:"+ New service",errorLog:"Report a problem",reportHint:"Something broke or works wrong? Send a report to the developer: it has the app version, the phone model and the recorded errors. Add what happened.",reportWhatsapp:"WhatsApp",reportMail:"Mail",reportShare:"Another app",reportShareSub:"Telegram, Viber and others — the full report is attached as a file",reportCopySub:"To paste into any message",reportCopied:"Report copied — paste it into a message to the developer",reportSend:"Send a report",reportErrors:"Errors on the phone:",reportErrorsTail:"There are many errors, the last ones are here. All of them are in the computer’s log and in the file attached through «Another app».",reportNoErrors:"No errors recorded on the phone.",clearLog:"Clear the error log",errorsCount:e=>`Errors recorded: ${e}.`,noErrors:"There were no errors.",errorsSent:"When connected, they go to the computer’s log (Data/logs/app.log).",copy:"Copy",clearConfirm:"Clear the error log on the phone? The computer keeps its records.",clear:"Clear",desktop:"Computer",searchingDesktop:"Looking for the computer on the network…",thisPhone:"This phone",reconnect:"Retry the connection",trouble:"If it doesn’t connect",troubleText:"The «Greeny» program must be open on the computer (it may be minimized), and «Phone access» must be on. The phone and the computer must be on the same Wi-Fi, not a guest one. The computer must not sleep. A laptop moved to another place is looked for in the phone’s Wi-Fi by itself; if it isn’t found — «Reconnect with the QR code».",theme:"Appearance",light:"Light",dark:"Dark",sy